{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puppy Love is a visual novel/dating sim starring the iconic<strong> Nanako Niku</strong>\u00a0- from Stellar Verse Productions' first generation, Infinium.\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A stinky NEET crosses your path...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On one of your many visits to a PC caf\u00e9 near home, you meet <strong>Nanako Niku</strong> - former Counter-Spike pro, current homeless woman. Despite her abrasive personality, she undoubtedly still has the skill of her glory days. And wouldn't you know it, you could really use a coach...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Now she's your roommate?!\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Nanako now under your wing in exchange for high-level coaching, it's up to you to decide her fate. Will you bend to her every whim and enable her terrible habits, or will you stand your ground and help her improve as a person? That's for you to decide!!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cartoony animation and visuals by<strong> Ducksen!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An utterly absurd love story featuring multiple endings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfy tunes from a variety of Newgrounds artists!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puppy Love is bound to be an experience you'll never forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">For better or for worse.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049790?t=1760132622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049790?t=176013262